    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-05818dea5a1ac9e65040764f",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在 1 型系统中确定 K_v 值的最简便方法是读取低频渐近线在 omega=1 rad/sec 处的幅值，因为该渐近线为 A(omega)=K_v/omega。或者，读取低频渐近线上任意频率处的幅值，并通过 K_v=omega A(omega) 进行计算。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The easiest way of determining the value of K_v in a Type 1 system is to read the magnitude of the low-frequency asymptote at omega=1 rad/sec, because this asymptote is A(omega)=K_v/omega. Alternately, read the magnitude at any frequency on the low-frequency asymptote and compute it from K_v=omega A(omega).",
